  "prefLabel": "Saf-Mec 504.01 Fees for Other Services",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 504.01 Fees for Other Services. Fees for other services shall be:\n\n(a) For an authenticated copy of a statement of good standing of an individual or business licensed or certified by the board: $25.00;\n\n(b) For a replacement business entity certificate: $35.00;\n\n(c) For a replacement wallet card: $25.00;\n\n(d) For a board-sponsored seminar, per person: $100.00;\n\n(e) For any type of license upgrade: $85.00.\n\n(f) For copies: $1.00 per page;\n\n(g) For CDs: $1.00 per CD, in addition to the fees in (f) and (h); and\n\n(h) For copies of photographs pertaining to closed cases: $1.00 per photo.\n\nSource. #10849, eff 7-1-15\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-mec500.html"
